                </div>
                <div class="p11-brow">
                    <span>Alternator (low speed)</span>
                    <div class="p11-bbar-track"><div class="p11-bbar p11-bbar-blue" style="width:7%"></div></div>
                    <span>~+280 W</span>
                </div>
                <div class="p11-brow p11-brow-highlight">
                    <span>Dynamo (Concept A/B combined)</span>
                    <div class="p11-bbar-track"><div class="p11-bbar p11-bbar-gold" style="width:27%"></div></div>
